WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.708 --> 00:00:02.750
[Mirana] Are you sure
you should be drinking?

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.166
-You don't look well.
-Hence the drinking.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.125
Uh, get you ladies something?
It's on the house.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.375
Just directions.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:13.041
We're looking for the Black Market.

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:17.458
What business do respectable ladies
have in a place like that?

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:19.000
Private business.

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:20.500
I meant no offense.

00:00:20.583 --> 00:00:24.541
It's on King's Way, uptown,
right off the main square.

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:25.958
You can't miss it.

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:27.750
Allow me to escort you.

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:31.208
It's not safe in the city after dark.
[vomits]

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:32.875
-Ugh!
-[retches]

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:35.250
You know how to impress a lady.

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:36.916
[Davion heaving]

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:37.916
[vomits]

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.250
[clanking]

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:43.041
Was that in your stomach? How?

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:45.000
[whimpers]
I don't know.

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:49.666
The fuck! Did you just heave up this ring?

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.958
This belonged to a friend of mine.
A brother.

00:00:54.041 --> 00:00:59.458
He was found on the road, torn to pieces,
with five more of my brothers.

00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:02.333
-You did this!
-No.

00:01:02.416 --> 00:01:05.416
They found dragon armor around the bodies.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.833
-"Davion the Dragon Knight."
-It's not possible!

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:10.708
-[thwacks]
-[grunts]

00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.958
Savage! Fucking cannibal!

00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:16.666
[grunts]

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:24.291
-[slams]
-[groans]

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:31.541
[whimpers]

00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:34.791
Tomorrow. Midday.

00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:37.583
My brothers and me, we're coming for you.

00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:40.625
You're a dead man.
You hear me? A dead man!

00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:46.166
-[Davion groaning]
-[thuds]

